### Mock Sathyabama ERP — sample requests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension, or copy into curl/Postman.
### Start the server first:  cd backend && npm start

@base = http://localhost:8787

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Login — valid seeded student  (returns an access token)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RegisterNumber": "41110999",
  "Password": "test123"
}

### Login — wrong password (should fail)
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RegisterNumber": "41110999",
  "Password": "nope"
}

### Decode the token from the login response above
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.responseData.login.accessToken}}

### Use the token against a data endpoint (the full login -> token -> data flow)
POST {{base}}/erp/api/v1.0/MasterStudent/view
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.responseData.login.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "StudentId": "{{login.response.body.responseData.login.StudentId}}" }
